# FX mode, Plate's page: hold ENV and turn KNOB1 (Mix) and KNOB2 (Decay):
# ENV1, which every note opens through its default cable, swells the
# reverb. Then SELECT to slot 2 (empty) and the same gesture finds nothing
# to reach there.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:FX
--button 0.20:ENV:0.6
--turn 0.30:KNOB1:40
--turn 0.45:KNOB2:-20
--turn 0.60:SELECT:9
--button 1.00:ENV:0.2
--turn 1.05:KNOB1:5
